  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">성공한 듯합니다!!! 실패 원인은 광축이 안맞아서 그런 듯합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">스크린을 2m정도에 두고 두 빛을 잘맞추니 간섭무늬가 보입니다.^^</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">거울을 하나씩 가렸을때 보이지 않던 무늬가 나타남으로써 간섭무늬임을 확인할수 있었습니다.^^</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">건물진동으로 간섭무늬가 물결치듯이 나타나네요~^^</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이승윤 선생님 감사합니다.^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95d406550d9c669ce80d5917513c7e3f8c56a4e1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/95d406550d9c669ce80d5917513c7e3f8c56a4e1\" data-origin-width=\"600\" data-origin-height=\"1067\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvo13lqrppaa85z4guketklz1@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvo13lqrppaa85z4guketklz1%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33196349956%26signature%3DKzHOd6p0UBX0UrnmMv%252BgQPxote4%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvo13lqrppaa85z4guketklz1?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2bzEzbHFycHBhYTg1ejRndWtldGtsejEiLCJ0aWQiOiI1NDliMTZiMC1iYzlmLTQ0ZjItOTY3Ny1lNDg3M2U2Y2I2M2UiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODczNDB9.fbgCT36V5XTPaDMVIuQuKRBmJRRlafhiSxeZG2TTkitH6QMBfjbZHPZKUs9VmNV8gQJQAKoJJ6VNL__QxecU4g&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe